{"id":"05d82ffd170fb7a6","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-black-node-oracle-test.md","title":"整个部分函数树的黑节点可由 0′ 检测","display":"lem-black-node-oracle-test — 整个部分函数树的黑节点可由 0′ 检测","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-black-node-oracle-test","aliases":["20-lem-black-node-oracle-test"],"display":"lem-black-node-oracle-test — 整个部分函数树的黑节点可由 0′ 检测","chapter":"13","section":"13.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"§13.4；式 (13.4)","source_printed_pages":[205],"source_pdf_pages":[235],"depends_on":["[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-function-tree]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-black-node-oracle-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-black-node-oracle-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-black-node-oracle-test — 整个部分函数树的黑节点可由 0′ 检测"},{"key":"chapter","html":"13"},{"key":"section","html":"13.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§13.4；式 (13.4)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>205</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>235</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 编码部分可计算函数树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j\">\\(T_j\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T_j)\">\\(\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T_j)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是对角停止集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的元数为 3，输入最后一个参数是节点编码。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTree}\">\\(\\operatorname{FTree}\\)</span> 表示部分函数树的结构谓词；所有有限串输入均用固定双射编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j\">\\(T_j\\)</span> 遍历部分可计算的串值程序。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black-node-oracle-test}\\vdash\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_3\\ \\left[\\operatorname{dom}(h)=\\omega^3\\land\n\\forall j,e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\nu\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \n\\left((\\operatorname{FTree}(T_j)\\land\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T_j))\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T_j)\\Longleftrightarrow h(j,e,\\operatorname{code}(\\nu))\\notin K\\right)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black-node-oracle-test}\\vdash\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_3\\ \\left[\\operatorname{dom}(h)=\\omega^3\\land\n\\forall j,e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\nu\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \n\\left((\\operatorname{FTree}(T_j)\\land\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T_j))\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T_j)\\Longleftrightarrow h(j,e,\\operatorname{code}(\\nu))\\notin K\\right)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用 s-m-n 编译搜索程序，枚举整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j\">\\(T_j\\)</span> 的值域与相应有限停止分裂见证；它停止当且仅当有分裂。所以停止集判断搜索是否停止，再取否定就检测黑性。域成员本身也是 c.e. 条件，可由同一 oracle 判定；不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j\">\\(T_j\\)</span> 已被证明全定义。该结果不使“存在某个黑节点”的无界问题降到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：§13.4；式 (13.4)；印刷页 205；PDF 第 235 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n<p>续修说明：该 uniform 搜索编译器对所有索引可构造；黑节点语义的等价只在 Hypothesis 所承诺的函数树与节点输入上使用。这里没有声称识别“j 是函数树”的整个指标集属于 0′。</p>\n<p>续修说明：全编译器的存在先于全部输入量词；函数树与节点条件放在蕴含前件内。括号明确把全性与黑节点等价分开，避免把整条合取误读为双条件的左项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-e-colored-node","status":"resolved","id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-colored-node","status":"resolved","id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-K]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-K]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"T_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T_j)","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FTree}","display":false},{"tex":"T_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black-node-oracle-test}\\vdash\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_3\\ \\left[\\operatorname{dom}(h)=\\omega^3\\land\n\\forall j,e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\nu\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ \n\\left((\\operatorname{FTree}(T_j)\\land\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T_j))\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T_j)\\Longleftrightarrow h(j,e,\\operatorname{code}(\\nu))\\notin K\\right)\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"T_j","display":false},{"tex":"T_j","display":false},{"tex":"0\\prime","display":false}],"bytes":2474,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e72efb02984d69c","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-node-oracle-test]]；see [[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]；see [[20-lem-minimality-tree]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-black-node-oracle-test]] — 章 13；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-black-node-oracle-test]]"}],"outgoing":["f2458da73bd8fe19","0e6b2238da5572e4","a4daa2d7bdea73d3","8ba6597a854c206f"]}